<h2>How to choose</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Open each option, also on your phone.</li>
  <li>Set the winner in <code>src/_data/site.yaml</code>: <code>theme: editorial</code>, <code>swiss</code> or <code>warm</code>. The homepage <em>and</em> all other pages switch to that style.</li>
  <li>Clean up: delete <code>src/design-options/</code>, the unused files in <code>src/_includes/home/</code> and <code>src/assets/css/themes/</code>, and the design-switcher partial.</li>
</ol>
<p class="muted">Note: all pages other than these three previews use the style set in <code>site.yaml</code> (currently <strong>{{ site.theme }}</strong>).</p>
